# SLM: Production Text-to-SQL Fine-Tuning Pipeline

> **Goal:** Fine-tune Small Language Models (SLMs) to generate accurate, production-ready SQL from natural language — with a focus on *real-world deployment accuracy*, not just benchmark scores.

