## Architecture Overview

```
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                     FULL PIPELINE FLOW                               │
├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                                                                      │
│  RAW DATA             PREPROCESSING              TRAINING            │
│  ┌─────────┐         ┌─────────────────┐        ┌──────────────┐    │
│  │ Spider  │──Load──▶│  SQL Cleaning   │──SFT──▶│  Unsloth +   │    │
│  │ BIRD    │         │  Schema Inject  │  JSONL  │  LoRA/PEFT   │    │
│  │ Gretel  │         │  ChatML Format  │        │  (Qwen/Llama) │    │
│  │ CSV/HF  │         └─────────────────┘        └──────┬───────┘    │
│  └─────────┘                                           │             │
│                                                        ▼             │
│                                               ┌──────────────┐      │
│  DEPLOYMENT          INFERENCE/EVAL           │  LoRA        │      │
│  ┌─────────┐◀────────┌─────────────────┐◀─── │  Adapters    │      │
│  │ Your    │  SQL     │ Schema Anchor   │     │  Saved to    │      │
│  │ App /   │         │ Prompt Builder  │     │  outputs/    │      │
│  │ API     │         │ SQL Extractor   │     └──────────────┘      │
│  └─────────┘         └─────────────────┘                           │
│                                                                      │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

### Component Responsibilities

| Component                  | Location                                                 | Responsibility                                           |
| -------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |
| **Orchestrator**           | `main.py`                                                | Single entry point for all pipeline stages               |
| **Config**                 | `src/core/config.py`                                     | YAML → dot-notation AppConfig object                     |
| **Schema Utils**           | `src/core/schemas.py`                                    | Table selection + FK expansion + prompt building         |
| **CSV Loader**             | `src/preprocessing/loaders/csv_loaders.py`               | Load CSV files as streaming generators                   |
| **HF Loader**              | `src/preprocessing/loaders/hf_loaders.py`                | Load HuggingFace datasets (local or hub)                 |
| **SFT Processor**          | `src/preprocessing/processors/base.py`                   | Map raw columns → instruction/input/output               |
| **JSONL Formatter**        | `src/preprocessing/formatters/base.py`                   | Write processed stream to .jsonl                         |
| **Preprocessing Pipeline** | `src/preprocessing/pipeline.py`                          | Orchestrate Load→Process→Format with progress            |
| **Trainer**                | `src/training/train.py`                                  | Unsloth + LoRA fine-tuning with early stopping           |
| **Evaluator**              | `src/training/evaluate.py`                               | Batch inference + Spider metric evaluation               |
| **Inference**              | `src/training/inference.py`                              | Single/batch SQL generation with result saving           |
| **Data Gatherer**          | `text2sql_dataset_preprocessing/src/gatherer.py`         | Download Spider/BIRD/Gretel from HF Hub                  |
| **SQL Cleaner**            | `text2sql_dataset_preprocessing/src/cleaner.py`          | `sqlglot`-based SQL validation + canonicalization        |
| **Schema Generator**       | `text2sql_dataset_preprocessing/src/schema_generator.py` | Reverse-engineer schemas from SQL if tables.json missing |

