## Project Structure

```
slm-text2sql/
│
├── main.py                              # ← START HERE: orchestrates all stages
├── config.yaml                          # ← Central configuration for everything
├── pyproject.toml                       # Dependencies + poe tasks
├── .env                                 # HF_TOKEN (create this yourself)
│
├── src/
│   ├── core/
│   │   ├── config.py                    # YAML loader, AppConfig dot-notation wrapper
│   │   ├── schemas.py                   # Schema loading, table selection, prompt building
│   │   └── utils.py                     # Shared Rich logger
│   │
│   ├── preprocessing/
│   │   ├── pipeline.py                  # Streaming pipeline with Rich progress bars
│   │   ├── base.py                      # Abstract base classes + LoaderRegistry
│   │   ├── loaders/
│   │   │   ├── csv_loaders.py           # CSV → streaming dict generator
│   │   │   └── hf_loaders.py           # HuggingFace → streaming dict generator
│   │   ├── processors/
│   │   │   └── base.py                  # Column mapping + row validation
│   │   └── formatters/
│   │       └── base.py                  # Write .jsonl to disk
│   │
│   └── training/
│       ├── train.py                     # Unsloth fine-tuning + LoRA injection
│       ├── evaluate.py                  # Batch evaluation + Spider metrics
│       └── inference.py                 # SQL generation + result export
│
├── text2sql_dataset_preprocessing/      # Standalone data prep module
│   ├── config.yml                       # Dataset sources (Spider, BIRD, Gretel)
│   ├── main.py                          # Gather → Clean → Format → Publish
│   └── src/
│       ├── gatherer.py                  # Download raw datasets from HF
│       ├── cleaner.py                   # SQL validation + normalization
│       ├── formatter.py                 # Convert to instruction-input-output format
│       ├── schema_parser.py             # Parse Spider tables.json
│       ├── schema_generator.py          # Reverse-engineer schemas from SQL
│       └── publisher.py                 # Push final dataset to HF Hub
│
├── scripts/
│   └── text2sql_synthetic_dataset_generation.py   # LLM-based data augmentation
│
├── data/
│   ├── raw/                             # Downloaded raw datasets (gitignored)
│   └── spider_sft/
│       └── train_sft.jsonl              # Final SFT training file
│
└── outputs/
    └── qwen-text2sql/                   # Fine-tuned LoRA adapters saved here
```

